WEBVTT

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:03.240
On the last episode of Dragon Ball Z,

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:07.620
the fighters began to arrive for the start of Cell's World Martial Arts Tournament.

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.020
And who better to appear first than the world-famous champion of show, Hercule?

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.280
And he brazenly predicted Cell's fate.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.320
Cell was not amused.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:21.500
And while Hercule and his announcer sidekick threw Cell a few childish taunts,

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.500
Vegeta arrived ringside.

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:25.680
And judging from his cold expression,

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.720
he seemed determined to make up for past defeats.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:29.910
the next one.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.040
The land was the newly repaired Android 16, and the others soon followed.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:39.980
Flying in tight formation, it was a dramatic entrance that impressed even Cell,

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:44.880
as he saw for the first time the high caliber of competition he would have to face.

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:47.760
But Cell was only concerned with one thing.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.200
Who would fight him first?

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.320
Welcome, welcome, everyone.

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.800
Goku seemed the obvious choice.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.830
But the hard-headed Hercule was quick to point out that he wanted to have the honor.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:09.550
The choice must be made quickly, because as Cell has anxiously announced,

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.580
it's time.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:19.590
Let the games begin, today on Dragon Ball Z!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:56.470
So who's the first to challenge you're looking at him? There's no use trying to stop him Goku

00:02:56.470 --> 00:02:59.430
He just won't listen. I've got to try

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:03.600
Listen to me, Mr. Hercule. If you fight Cell, you'll be destroyed.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:13.190
Okay, Nigel. Get a close-up of the guy with the big hair.

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:15.820
Got it. Are we on? Oh, good.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:22.620
Only moments ago, this long-haired hippie had the gall to tell the people's hero, Hercule, to back out of the tournament.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.920
Imagine telling the martial arts champion of the world he was going to be defeated.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:29.970
Having followed Hercule's...

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.780
career over the years. I have just one question to ask this know-it-all brat. Who do you think

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:36.560
you are?

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:47.930
If the director leaves the ring, can the main event continue?

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:53.080
Boy, in all the years as a sports announcer, I've never seen anything so unprofessional.

00:03:53.340 --> 00:03:56.420
Sir, that blonde guy is quite a fool, wouldn't you say?

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.200
I know him.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:03:58.640
Oh?

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:07.000
For someone who looked like him, many years ago there was a young lad who saved the earth

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.880
from the evil King Piccolo.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.600
I'll never forget the innocent look on that boy's face.

00:04:13.260 --> 00:04:20.600
But his eyes, his eyes look different, and so does the color of his hair.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:27.580
Perhaps I'm just getting old and my memory isn't what it used to be, and yet somehow

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:28.760
I just know.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.280
It must be him.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.710
Ah, look at the green one.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.800
He's the spitting image of King Piccolo.

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:43.330
If that doofus wants to fight Cell first, then let him.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.630
If he's defeated, then we'll just revive him with the Dragon Balls.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.830
Well, there seems to be no other choice.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.990
They finally decided not to interfere.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:59.680
And for those of you watching this out there, you've got to be ecstatic!

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.640
It's time for our champ!

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.280
Get a load of me!

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.980
So here's how it'll unfold.

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.520
The first to fight will be Hercule,

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.000
who, of course, will win,

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.120
and then the Earth will be saved from total annihilation!

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:14.580
Hold on, everybody!

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.680
It's time to get happy!

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:19.690
Oh, is it really them?

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:21.540
That's right!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.360
The fabulous duo is here!

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:25.800
One's got grace, one's got strength,

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.620
and everybody's got the love!

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.720
Love? For what?

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:41.370
Looks like we have new challenges to take on Sal!

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.850
But who are they? And where are they from?

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.780
Must be National Goofball Day.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:51.130
We are the protégés of Hercule!

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.700
Gaze upon me, I am Korone.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:07.900
I am the stupidest strongman, Porosky.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:18.040
Could these be the amazing and often talked about men of Hercule?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.800
That's right, my friend.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:26.380
These two are the senior disciples of Hercule's world-renowned martial arts dojo.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.980
So let's make way for our raw men of muscle, Porosky.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:34.800
That's great! And who are you?

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:39.500
I am their beautiful manager, Ms. Pisa!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.740
Maestro, please let us take care of him.

00:06:43.940 --> 00:06:46.840
There's no point in you wasting energy on this sissy.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:49.160
I'll squash him like a bug!

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:51.740
Hmm, you're right.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.500
It could be a little embarrassing for me to fight such an amateur like Sal.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.120
He's all yours!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:07.190
Wahoo! You heard it here first, folks! We have some new challengers!

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:12.540
And this dynamic duo will replace their mentor Hercule in round one!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:14.540
What a turn of events!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:18.360
Ladies and gentlemen, this is great news!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.680
With the skill of Hercule's talented students, how can we fail?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.050
We can't lose!

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.710
I've seen those two in a magazine!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.640
From what I understand, as a tag team, they've never lost a match in their whole career!

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.660
This is awesome!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.540
What fool!

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.820
See? They're toast.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.890
Let the Cell games begin!

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:52.230
Introducing Cell's first challenger in the white spandex jumpsuit, the lovely Karoni!

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:57.630
Since this is the first chance we've had to fight or whatnot, I'll be gentle.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.640
Those are for you.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:24.730
A bouquet for your funeral.

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:27.360
Boy, he's good.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.890
And I bet you this won't last.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.440
more than one round.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:33.380
For our home viewers,

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:35.230
Caroni's special skill

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.790
is being able to obliterate

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:37.750
anything in the air

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.810
with his amazing speed

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:39.570
and agility.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:41.150
Thank you, Pisa.

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:43.720
So, there you have it, folks.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:45.580
Now let's see him in action.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.250
He's giving me a headache.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.190
I wonder how many beautiful women

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.950
are watching me right now.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:08:59.480
That tension is starting to build

00:08:59.480 --> 00:08:59.980
as Caroni...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.160
Karony warms up for the first round of the Cell Games!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.630
The rules are quite simple.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.770
You lose if you fall out of the ring, give up, or...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.420
...are destroyed!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.080
You look nervous.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.920
Don't worry, it'll all be over before you know it.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.640
Beautifully flying...

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:21.640
...ROSE...

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:22.860
...AHHHHH!

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:26.540
Would you look at that!

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.490
That's the greatest move in Karony's repertoire!

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:32.170
Just wait till you see how it ends.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.800
Let's finish this.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:56.420
I think he's coming down.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:59.050
He's in way better shape than I thought.

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.840
Huh? What's that noise?

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.320
My hair. My hair.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:20.100
Well, Pisa, you're right. That was a big ending.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.360
Yeah, too bad he couldn't land inside the ring, huh?

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:23.680
Huh?

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:29.980
In my fighting dojo, I always consider...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:36.370
Caroni to be the son I never had, but he never quite measured up to his father.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:38.780
You're the best.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:39.830
And how?

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:58.990
Folks, Caroni the first challenger in these cell games.

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:01.240
If I fall in a...

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.360
It's my turn!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:23.110
He has the strength of 20 elephants to lose.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:27.520
Then he's come to the right place!

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:37.210
Retreat!

00:11:37.820 --> 00:11:38.940
Oh, nasty.

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:49.980
I've never seen anything like that!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.440
I think that Zell's met his match!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.280
Get ready for round two!

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:20.050
It seems Pirozki is on his way to victory!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.640
And he's performing his special attack,

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.630
the Mega-Ton Bowl Crusher!

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.470
No one has ever bowed!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.110
It's a siege!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:19.770
Goodness, he's supposed to explain this one. Hey, her kill another trick

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:29.080
You can't see the forest for the trees. It's quite clear to me that he's somehow rigged the ring case in point

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:29.660
Maybe

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:34.660
Sal coated himself with jalapeno pepper juice, which Perovsky is allergic to.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.340
Or perhaps he planted magnets under the ring.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.400
But I, Hercule, vow to reveal his cheating ways.

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:45.580
Yes, I see.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:49.060
So it was Sal's dirty tricks that beat them.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:54.000
Well, look out, Sal, because Hercule's got a few tricks of his own off his sleeve.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:55.950
What can they be?

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:59.710
Sal's energy flicked them away, not some dirty trick.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.810
It's like talking to a wall.

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.070
This is it, folks.

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:05.590
Hercule has had enough of these shenanigans.

00:14:05.890 --> 00:14:08.210
He's taking matters into his own hands.

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.950
And now he will finish Cell off himself.

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.930
He's taking off his cape, and he's holding up his championship belt.

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:17.830
It looks like a tremendous battle is about to begin.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:29.970
In the next few minutes, the fate of the entire planet will be decided between Cell and the...

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.290
undisputed martial arts champion of the world.

00:14:32.490 --> 00:14:33.850
And I'm not too worried

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:35.530
because Hercule promised to give Cell

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.190
a hand through the stomach.

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:41.060
But what's this?

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:43.160
Hercule is reaching into his robe

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:44.340
and pulling something out.

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:45.720
It looks like a...

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:46.720
a capsule!

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:54.890
Travel bag!

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.510
What will those brilliant minds

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:58.310
at Capsule Corporation think of next?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:14:59.970
Well, here we go.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:06.520
everyone! Hercule is unzipping the bag and reaching inside. Aha! They look like

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:17.080
ceramic tiles! Hercule is now stacking the tiles! Oh, man! This guy's a Goomba. He's

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:28.070
just piled them 15 tiles high! You don't think that he'll try to break all 15

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.310
tiles at once, do you?

00:15:33.720 --> 00:15:40.040
He's now immersed in a trance-like state

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:45.470
I believe he's focusing his energy for something incredible

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.820
Let's watch and see what happens

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:17.060
And what a mind-blowing display of power!

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:19.330
Fourteen tiles at one time!

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:21.890
I'm sure any normal man would struggle with two or three!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:22.870
Incredible!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:49.900
Ignorances.

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.220
You see these broken pieces of tile on the ground?

00:16:58.830 --> 00:16:59.390
It's...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.120
I'm going to do to you.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:19.750
Listen, Hercule is the undisputed martial arts champion

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:20.770
of the world.

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.340
Yeah, yeah.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.920
I'm just glad I remembered to set my VCR before leaving home

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:29.180
so I could record this special moment.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:32.740
It looks like Cell is getting worried.

00:17:33.160 --> 00:17:37.460
But then again, who wouldn't after seeing such an awesome display of power from Hercule?

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.120
This is getting good!

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.010
It is payback time, folks!

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:46.140
Cell's made his ring, and now he'll have to lie in it!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.360
Let's go!

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:53.700
It appears as though Hercule is ready to fight.

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:59.980
It's hard to believe that Hercule's iron hands are finally going to enact some revenge on Cell for what he's done to all...

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:04.560
innocent people of earth in just a few moments it will all be over so don't you

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:15.380
dare blink an eye it's all up to you now hercule we're depending on you

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.970
hercule started with his tried and true

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.560
patented dynamite karate kick!

00:18:40.860 --> 00:18:42.020
Absolutely amazing!

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:44.360
The man is a regular fighting machine!

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.300
He just keeps on attacking!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.280
Look at his speed, his agility!

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.280
It's like he's performing a ballet of punches!

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.300
And Hercules is too fast for Cell to even fight back!

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.920
Oh! This is incredible!

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:20.030
Gohan, I was cheering for Cell to win that little scrap.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:27.420
He's still alive.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:29.980
I guess Cell didn't want to waste anything.

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:47.840
the energy on that weakling landed outside of the ring that means our hero has lost the battle

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:59.880
now let's get the real games underway who will be the first one will it be goku if

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:00.920
He so dares.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:11.660
Let's do it!

00:20:13.436 --> 00:20:14.456
After all the talk.

00:20:14.684 --> 00:20:17.644
All the training, all the idle threats.

00:20:18.044 --> 00:20:20.284
The time has finally arrived.

00:20:20.636 --> 00:20:22.596
It's Goku versus Cell.

00:20:23.164 --> 00:20:24.804
Stay tuned.

00:20:28.732 --> 00:20:29.992
Hey everyone, this is Goku.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.000
And I just want you to know that you don't have to wait any longer.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:35.340
My big fight against Cell is finally here!

00:20:35.692 --> 00:20:40.492
We've both been preparing long and hard for this one, and I promise, it's gonna be a real doozy!

00:20:40.812 --> 00:20:41.312
Oh yeah!

00:20:41.548 --> 00:20:44.788
I know you've all been wondering why I'm so confident about defeating Cell,

00:20:44.908 --> 00:20:49.468
and all I can say is you'll find out on the next action-packed episode of Dragon Ball Z.
